Some months ago, I had a problem getting numbers out of the numberpad
on my SPARC. Someone pointed me to a fix or sent a fix to me. Since
I've seen several requests for a solution to this problem, and I know
I'd recieve quite a few requests for this creature, I've attached it
below. You'll need to read the xnumlock.readme and possibly edit the
script to fix a path or so...

So, here's a shell archive of Jamie Zawinski's nice little
routine... hack away...

Enjoy

mh
